  "Question": "Straightening a winding road shortens the travel distance. The mathematical basis for this is",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "The perpendicular segment is the shortest",
    "B": "Two points determine a line",
    "C": "Supplementary angles of the same angle are equal",
    "D": "The line segment between two points is the shortest path"
